--------------------
The assertion Debug.Assert(New_Ret >= 0); is used to ensure that the size of the stack is always greater than or equal to 0. It means that the count of items in the stack cannot be negative.

--------------------
The natural language assertion that describes the assertion code: Debug.Assert(New_Ret >= 0); is "// @@@ The size of the stack is always greater than or equal to 0".

--------------------
// The size of the stack is always greater than or equal to 0

